#: kio/kio/global.cpp:530
msgid ""
"Contact your appropriate computer support system, whether the system "
"administrator, or technical support group for further assistance."
msgstr ""
"Skontaktujće so z administratorom systema abo ze support-skupinu "
"dalšeje pomocy dla."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:533
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server for further assistance."
msgstr "Skontaktujće so z administratorom servera dalšeje pomocy dla."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:536
msgid "Check your access permissions on this resource."
msgstr "Přepruwujće swoje přistupne prawa na tutej resursy."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:537
msgid ""
"Your access permissions may be inadequate to perform the requested operation "
"on this resource."
msgstr "Twoje přistupne prawa su snano njedosahace za tutu akciju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:539
msgid "The file may be in use (and thus locked) by another user or application."
msgstr ""
"Dataja so snano wot druheho wužiwarja abo programa wužiwa a "
"je tuž blokowana."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:541
msgid ""
"Check to make sure that no other application or user is using the file or "
"has locked the file."
msgstr "Přepruwuj, hač njeje druhi program abo wužiwar blokował."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:543
msgid "Although unlikely, a hardware error may have occurred."
msgstr "Hačrunjež njeje to prawdźepodobne, je so snadź hardwareowy zmylk stał."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:545
msgid "You may have encountered a bug in the program."
msgstr "Snadź sće na zmylk w programje storčili."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:546
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the program. Please consider "
"submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Wina je najskerje programowy zmylk. Prošu posćel kompletnu rozprawu "
"wo zmylku."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:548
msgid ""
"Update your software to the latest version. Your distribution should provide "
"tools to update your software."
msgstr ""
"Instalujće najnowšu wersiju programa. waša distribucija by dyrbjała "
"wotpowědne update-móžnosće k dispoziciji stajiła."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:550
msgid ""
"When all else fails, please consider helping the KDE team or the third party "
"maintainer of this software by submitting a high quality bug report. If the "
"software is provided by a third party, please contact them directly. "
"Otherwise, first look to see if the same bug has been submitted by someone "
"else by searching at the <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">KDE bug reporting "
"website</a>. If not, take note of the details given above, and include them "
"in your bug report, along with as many other details as you think might help."
msgstr ""
"Jako poslednju móžnosć prošu pomhajće KDE-teamej abo maintainerej "
"tutoho programa z kwalitnej rozprawu wo zmylku. Přińdźe-li program "
"wot třećeje strony, prošu skontaktujće so z nimi bjezposrědnje. "
"Hewak najprjedy pohladajće na <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">KDE "
"bug report website</a>, hač njeje hižo něchtó druhi wo samsnym zmylku "
"rozprawił. Jeli nic, připisajće prošu horjeka podatu informaciju do swojeje "
"rozprawy wo zmylku a podajće tak wjele dalšeje informacije, kaž "
"maće za spomožnu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:558
msgid "There may have been a problem with your network connection."
msgstr "Snano maće problem ze swojim zwiskom na syć."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:561
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration. If you have "
"been accessing the Internet with no problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""
"Snadź je so wujewił problem z wašej syćowej konfiguraciju. Jeli pak "
"njejsu w poslednim času problemy z přistupom na internet byli, "
"njeje to prawdźepodobne."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:564
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem at some point along the network path between "
"the server and this computer."
msgstr ""
"Najskerje je něhdźe po puću mjez serverom a tutym computerom problem "
"ze zwiskom."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:566
msgid "Try again, either now or at a later time."
msgstr "Spytajće hišće raz, pak hnydom pak pozdźišo."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:567
msgid "A protocol error or incompatibility may have occurred."
msgstr "Protokolowy zmylk abo njekompatibelnosć je so wujewiła."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:568
msgid "Ensure that the resource exists, and try again."
msgstr "Přepruwuj, hač resursa eksistuje, a spytajće hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:569
msgid "The specified resource may not exist."
msgstr "pominana resursa snano njeeksistuje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:570
msgid "You may have incorrectly typed the location."
msgstr "Snadź je so městno njekorektnje zapodała."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:571
msgid "Double-check that you have entered the correct location and try again."
msgstr "Přepruwuj, hač sće městno prawje zapodali a spytajće hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:573
msgid "Check your network connection status."
msgstr "Přepruwujće zwisk ze syću."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:577
msgid "Cannot Open Resource For Reading"
msgstr "Njemóžu resursu wočinić za čitanje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:578
msgid ""
"This means that the contents of the requested file or directory <strong>%1</"
"strong> could not be retrieved, as read access could not be obtained."
msgstr ""
"To rěka, zo so wobsah pominaneje dataje abo zapiska <strong>%1</strong> "
"njeje móhła wobstarać, dokelž nimaće prawo čitanja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:581
msgid "You may not have permissions to read the file or open the directory."
msgstr "Snano nimaće prawo dataju čitać abo zapisk wočinić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:587
msgid "Cannot Open Resource For Writing"
msgstr "Njemóžu resursu wočinić za pisanje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:588
msgid ""
"This means that the file, <strong>%1</strong>, could not be written to as "
"requested, because access with permission to write could not be obtained."
msgstr ""
"To rěka, zo so do pominaneje dataje abo zapiska <strong>%1</strong> "
"njeje móhło pisać, dokelž nimaće prawo pisanja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:596
msgid "Cannot Initiate the %1 Protocol"
msgstr "Njemóžu protokol %1 přihotować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:597
msgid "Unable to Launch Process"
msgstr "Njemóžu proces startować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:598
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol could not be started. This is usually due to technical "
"reasons."
msgstr ""
"Program na wašim computeru, kiž posłužuje protokol <strong>%1</strong>, "
"njeje so startować móhł. To ma zwjetša techniske přičiny."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:601
msgid ""
"The program which provides compatibility with this protocol may not have "
"been updated with your last update of KDE. This can cause the program to be "
"incompatible with the current version and thus not start."
msgstr ""
"Program, kiž kompatibelnosć z tutym protokolom zaruča, so najskerje "
"njeje z wašim poslednim aktualizowanjom KDE sobu aktualizował. Jako "
"sćěh móže program z tutej wersiju njekompatibelny być a njehodźi so "
"startować."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:609
msgid "Internal Error"
msgstr "Nutřkowny zmylk"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:610
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has reported an internal error."
msgstr ""
"Protokol na wašim computeru, kiž zaruča zwisk k protokolej <strong>%1</strong> "
" je na nutřkowny zmylk storčił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:618
msgid "Improperly Formatted URL"
msgstr "Njekorektny format URL"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:619
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</"
"strong>ocator (URL) that you entered was not properly formatted. The format "
"of a URL is generally as follows:<blockquote><strong>protocol://user:"
"password@www.example.org:port/directory/filename.extension?query=value</"
"strong></blockquote>"
msgstr ""
"URL, kiž sće zapodali, nima korektny format. Format URL je zwjetša "
"tajki:<blockquote><strong>protokol://wužiwar:hesło@www.heksempl.org:port/zapisk/dataja.ekstensija "
"?wariabla=hódnota</strong></blockquote>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:628
#, c-format
msgid "Unsupported Protocol %1"
msgstr "Njepodpěrany protokol %1"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:629
msgid ""
"The protocol <strong>%1</strong> is not supported by the KDE programs "
"currently installed on this computer."
msgstr ""
"Protokol <strong>%1</strong> so wot KDE-programow, kiž su tuchwilu "
"instalowane, njepodpěruje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:632
msgid "The requested protocol may not be supported."
msgstr "Pominany protokol so najskerje njepodpěruje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:633
msgid ""
"The versions of the %1 protocol supported by this computer and the server "
"may be incompatible."
msgstr ""
"Wersije protokola %1, kiž tutón computer podpěruje, najskerje njejsu kompatibelne "
"k tym, kiž server poskića."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:635
msgid ""
"You may perform a search on the Internet for a KDE program (called a "
"kioslave or ioslave) which supports this protocol. Places to search include "
"<a href=\"http://apps.kde.com/\">http://apps.kde.com/</a> and <a href="
"\"http://freshmeat.net/\">http://freshmeat.net/</a>."
msgstr ""
"Móžeće w interneće KDE-program (tak pomjenowany kioslave abo ioslave) "
"pytać, kiž tutón protokol podpěruje. Pyta so mjez druhim "
"w <a href=\"http://apps.kde.com/\">http://apps.kde.com/</a> a <a href="
"\"http://freshmeat.net/\">http://freshmeat.net/</a>."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:644
msgid "URL Does Not Refer to a Resource."
msgstr "URL njewotkazuje na resursu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:645
msgid "Protocol is a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol je filtrowy protokol"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:646
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</"
"strong>ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a specific resource."
msgstr "URL, kiž sće zapodali, njewotkazuje na specifisku resursu."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:649
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol; the "
"protocol specified is only for use in such situations, however this is not "
"one of these situations. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""
"KDE móže přez protokol we wobłuku druheho protokola komunikować; "
"specifikowany protokol pak hodźi so jenož za tajke pady. To je rědki "
"pad a pokazuje najskerje na zmylk programa."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:657
#, c-format
msgid "Unsupported Action: %1"
msgstr "Njepodpěrowana akcija %1"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:658
msgid ""
"The requested action is not supported by the KDE program which is "
"implementing the <strong>%1</strong> protocol."
msgstr ""
"Pominana akcija so njepodpěruje wot KDE-programa, kiž implementuje "
"protokol %1."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:661
msgid ""
"This error is very much dependent on the KDE program. The additional "
"information should give you more information than is available to the KDE "
"input/output architecture."
msgstr ""
"Tutón zmylk wotwisuje wot KDE-programa. Dodatna informacija dyrbjała "
"ći wjace informacije dać, hač steji I/O-architekturje k dispoziciji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:664
msgid "Attempt to find another way to accomplish the same outcome."
msgstr "Pytaj hinašu móžnosć samsny cil dócpěć."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:669
msgid "File Expected"
msgstr "Sym z dataju ličił"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:670
msgid ""
"The request expected a file, however the directory <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr ""
"Akcija je dataju wočakowała, je pak zapisk <strong>%1</strong> "
"namakała."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:672
msgid "This may be an error on the server side."
msgstr "To móže być zmylk ze strony servera."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:677
msgid "Directory Expected"
msgstr "Sym ze zapiskom ličił"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:678
msgid ""
"The request expected a directory, however the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"found instead."
msgstr ""
"Akcija je zapisk wočakowała, je pak dataju <strong>%1</strong> "
"namakała."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:685
msgid "File or Directory Does Not Exist"
msgstr "Dataja abo zapisk njeeksistuje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:686
msgid "The specified file or directory <strong>%1</strong> does not exist."
msgstr "Specifikowana dataja abo zapisk <strong>%1</strong> njeeksistuje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:694
msgid ""
"The requested file could not be created because a file with the same name "
"already exists."
msgstr ""
"Pominana dataja so njeje stworiła, dokelž dataja z tajkim mjenom hižo "
"eksistuje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:696
msgid "Try moving the current file out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "Přesuń aktualnu dataju a spytaj potom hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:698
msgid "Delete the current file and try again."
msgstr "Znič aktualnu dataju a spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:699
msgid "Choose an alternate filename for the new file."
msgstr "Wubjerće sej hinaše pomjenowanje za nowu dataju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:704
msgid ""
"The requested directory could not be created because a directory with the "
"same name already exists."
msgstr "Pominany zapisk so njeje stworił, dokelž eksistuje hižo zapisk ze samsnym mjenom."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:706
msgid "Try moving the current directory out of the way first, and then try again."
msgstr "Přesuń aktualny zapisk a spytaj potom hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:708
msgid "Delete the current directory and try again."
msgstr "Znič aktualny zapisk a spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:709
msgid "Choose an alternate name for the new directory."
msgstr "Wubjerće sej hinaše pomjenowanje za nowy zapisk."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:713
msgid "Unknown Host"
msgstr "Njeznaty host"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:714
msgid ""
"An unknown host error indicates that the server with the requested name, "
"<strong>%1</strong>, could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Zmylk \"Njeznaty host\" praji, zo so server z mjenom <strong>%1</strong> "
"njehodźeše w interneće namakać."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:717
msgid "The name that you typed, %1, may not exist: it may be incorrectly typed."
msgstr ""
"Mjeno, kiž sće zapodali, %1, snadź njeeksistuje; snano je so wopak "
"zapodało."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:724
msgid "Access Denied"
msgstr "Přistup wotpokazany"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:725
msgid "Access was denied to the specified resource, <strong>%1</strong>."
msgstr "Přistup k specifikowanej resursy <strong>%1</strong> je so wotpokazał."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:727 kio/kio/global.cpp:943
msgid "You may have supplied incorrect authentication details or none at all."
msgstr "Daty za awtentifikaciju móhli być wopak abo faluja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:729 kio/kio/global.cpp:945
msgid "Your account may not have permission to access the specified resource."
msgstr "Waš account snadź njedowoli přistup k pominanej resursy."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:731 kio/kio/global.cpp:947 kio/kio/global.cpp:959
msgid ""
"Retry the request and ensure your authentication details are entered "
"correctly."
msgstr "Spytaj hišće raz a přepruwujće,hač je awtentifikacija korektna."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:737
msgid "Write Access Denied"
msgstr "Pospyt pisanja wotpokazany"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:738
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to write to the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"rejected."
msgstr "To rěka, zo so wam njeje dowoliło, do dataje <strong>%1</strong> pisać."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:745
msgid "Unable to Enter Directory"
msgstr "Njemóžu zapisk wočinić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:746
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to enter (in other words, to open) the requested "
"directory <strong>%1</strong> was rejected."
msgstr "To rěka, zo je so pospyt zapisk <strong>%1</strong> wočinić, wotpokazał."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:754
msgid "Directory Listing Unavailable"
msgstr "Čitanje zapiska njeje móžne"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:755
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filesystem"
msgstr "Protokol %1 njeje datajowy system"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:756
msgid ""
"This means that a request was made which requires determining the contents "
"of the directory, and the KDE program supporting this protocol is unable to "
"do so."
msgstr ""
"To rěka, zo je so spytało wobsah zapiska čitać, a KDE-program, kiž "
"tutón protokol podpěruje, njeje móhł akciju wuwjesć."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:764
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected"
msgstr "Cykliski link namakał"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:765
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or directory to a "
"separate name and/or location. KDE detected a link or series of links that "
"results in an infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps in a roundabout "
"way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""
"UNIX-systemy móža zwjetša link (wotkaz) na dataju abo zapisk tworić. "
"KDE je link namakał, kiž rezultuje w bjezkónčnym wotkazowanju, to rěka, "
"zo je dataja (přez někotre mjezystacije) na sebje wotkazała."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:769 kio/kio/global.cpp:791
msgid ""
"Delete one part of the loop in order that it does not cause an infinite "
"loop, and try again."
msgstr "Znič jedyn z linkow a spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:778
msgid "Request Aborted By User"
msgstr "Akcija wot wužiwarja přetorhnjena"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:779 kio/kio/global.cpp:1072
msgid "The request was not completed because it was aborted."
msgstr "Akcija so njeje zakónčiła, dokelž je ju wužiwar přetorhnył."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:781 kio/kio/global.cpp:975 kio/kio/global.cpp:1074
msgid "Retry the request."
msgstr "Spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:785
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected During Copy"
msgstr "Cykliski link při kopěrowanju namakał"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:786
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or directory to a "
"separate name and/or location. During the requested copy operation, KDE "
"detected a link or series of links that results in an infinite loop - i.e. "
"the file was (perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""
"UNIX-systemy móža zwjetša link (wotkaz) na dataju abo zapisk tworić. "
"KDE je link namakał, kiž rezultuje w bjezkónčnym wotkazowanju, to rěka, "
"zo je dataja (přez někotre mjezystacije) na sebje wotkazała."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:796
msgid "Could Not Create Network Connection"
msgstr "Njemóžach syćowy zwisk nastajić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:797
msgid "Could Not Create Socket"
msgstr "Njemóžach socket stworić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:798
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be created."
msgstr ""
"To je chětro techniski zmylk: trěbny device za komunikaciju w syći "
"so njeje móhł stworić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:800 kio/kio/global.cpp:913 kio/kio/global.cpp:924
#: kio/kio/global.cpp:933
msgid ""
"The network connection may be incorrectly configured, or the network "
"interface may not be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Syćowe zwiski móhli być njekorektnje konfigurowane, abo "
"syćowy interface njeje zapnjety."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:806
msgid "Connection to Server Refused"
msgstr "Zwisk ze serverom wotpokazany"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:807
msgid ""
"The server <strong>%1</strong> refused to allow this computer to make a "
"connection."
msgstr "Server <strong>%1</strong> je zwisk z tutym computerom wotpokazał."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:809
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be configured "
"to allow requests."
msgstr ""
"Server, hačrunjež na internet přizamknjeny, snadź njeje konfigurowany, "
"zo by tajke akcije dowolił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:811
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be running "
"the requested service (%1)."
msgstr "Server, hačrunjež na internet přizamknjeny, snadź njepodpěruje service (%1)."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:813
msgid ""
"A network firewall (a device which restricts Internet requests), either "
"protecting your network or the network of the server, may have intervened, "
"preventing this request."
msgstr "Firewall (pak na wašim boku pak na boku servera) móže akciji haćić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:820
msgid "Connection to Server Closed Unexpectedly"
msgstr "Zwisk ze serverom njejapcy přetorhnjeny"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:821
msgid ""
"Although a connection was established to <strong>%1</strong>, the connection "
"was closed at an unexpected point in the communication."
msgstr ""
"Hačrunjež bě so zwisk z <strong>%1</strong> natwarił, je so komunikacija "
"njewočakowanje přetorhnyła."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:824
msgid ""
"A protocol error may have occurred, causing the server to close the "
"connection as a response to the error."
msgstr ""
"Snadź je so protokolowy zmylk stał, a server je na tutón zmylk z přetorhnjenjom "
"zwiska reagował."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:830
msgid "URL Resource Invalid."
msgstr "Njekorektna URL-resursa."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:831
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "Protokol %1 njeje filtrowy protokol"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:832
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</"
"strong>ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a valid mechanism of "
"accessing the specific resource, <strong>%1%2</strong>."
msgstr ""
"URL, kotryž sće zapodali, njereferuje na žadyn walidny mechanizm, "
"po kotrymž hodźi so přistup na <strong>%1%2</strong> dóstać."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:837
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol. This "
"request specified a protocol be used as such, however this protocol is not "
"capable of such an action. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""
"KDE móže přez protokol we wobłuku druheho protokola komunikować; "
"specifikowany protokol pak njehodźi so jenož za tajke pady. To je rědki "
"pad a pokazuje najskerje na zmylk programa."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:845
msgid "Unable to Initialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Njemóžu I/O-device přihotować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:846
msgid "Could Not Mount Device"
msgstr "Njemóžach device montować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:847
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be initialized (\"mounted\"). The reported "
"error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Pominany grat njehodźeše so přihotować (\"montować\"). "
"Zmylk bě: <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:850
msgid ""
"The device may not be ready, for example there may be no media in a "
"removable media device (i.e. no CD-ROM in a CD drive), or in the case of a "
"peripheral/portable device, the device may not be correctly connected."
msgstr ""
"Grat snadź njebě hotowy, na př. je snadź medium falował (žana "
"CD w CD-ROM a pod.), abo w padźe periferneho/nošneho devicea, "
"wón snadź njebě prawje přizamknjeny."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:854
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to initialize (\"mount\") the device. On UNIX "
"systems, often system administrator privileges are required to initialize a "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Nimaće prawa grat přihotować (\"montować\"). Na UNIXowych "
"systemach trjebaš husto prawa administratora za tajke wěcy."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:858
msgid ""
"Check that the device is ready; removable drives must contain media, and "
"portable devices must be connected and powered on.; and try again."
msgstr ""
"Přepruwujće,hač je grat hotowy: w CD-ROMje dyrbi CD tčeć, scannery, "
"ćišćaki atd. dyrbja być přizamknjene a zaswěćene. Potom spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:864
msgid "Unable to Uninitialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr "Njemóžach I/O-device deinicializować."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:865
msgid "Could Not Unmount Device"
msgstr "Njemóžach grat wotmontować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:866
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be uninitialized (\"unmounted\"). The "
"reported error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Pominany grat njehodźeše so deinicializować (\"wotmontować\"). "
"Zmylk bě: <strong>%1</strong>"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:869
msgid ""
"The device may be busy, that is, still in use by another application or "
"user. Even such things as having an open browser window on a location on "
"this device may cause the device to remain in use."
msgstr ""
"Grat snadź hišće dźěła, to rěka, zo druhi wužiwar abo program jón "
"hišće trjeba. Samo wočinjene wokno browsera, kiž pokazuje městno "
"na tutym graće, móže tutón zmylk wuwołać."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:873
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to uninitialize (\"unmount\") the device. On "
"UNIX systems, system administrator privileges are often required to "
"uninitialize a device."
msgstr ""
"Snadź nimaće prawa grat deinicializować (\"wotmontować\"). "
" Na UNIXowych systemach trjebaš husto prawa administratora "
"za tajke wěcy. "

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:877
msgid "Check that no applications are accessing the device, and try again."
msgstr "Přepruwujće,hač žane programy tutón grat njewužiwaja, a spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:882
msgid "Cannot Read From Resource"
msgstr "Njemóžu resursu čitać"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:883
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while reading the contents of the resource."
msgstr ""
"To rěka, zo bě drje móžno resursu <strong>%1</strong> wočinić, "
"při čitanju pak je so zmylk stał. "

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:886
msgid "You may not have permissions to read from the resource."
msgstr "Snadź nimaće prawa z tuteje resursy čitać."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:895
msgid "Cannot Write to Resource"
msgstr "Njemóžu na resursu pisać"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:896
msgid ""
"This means that although the resource, <strong>%1</strong>, was able to be "
"opened, an error occurred while writing to the resource."
msgstr ""
"To rěka, zo bě drje móžno resursu <strong>%1</strong> wočinić, "
"při pisanju pak je so zmylk stał."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:899
msgid "You may not have permissions to write to the resource."
msgstr "Snadź nimaće prawa na resursu pisać."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:908 kio/kio/global.cpp:919
msgid "Could Not Listen for Network Connections"
msgstr "Njemóžach za syćowy zwisk dóstać"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:909
msgid "Could Not Bind"
msgstr "Njemóžach wjazać"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:910 kio/kio/global.cpp:921
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be established to listen for incoming "
"network connections."
msgstr ""
"To je chětro techniski zmylk, kiž rěka, zo njebě móžno, grat za syćowe "
"komunikacije (tak mj. socket) nastajić za zwiski wot wonka."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:920
msgid "Could Not Listen"
msgstr "Njemóžach słuchać"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:930
msgid "Could Not Accept Network Connection"
msgstr "Njemóžach syćowy zwisk akceptować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:931
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which an error occurred while attempting "
"to accept an incoming network connection."
msgstr ""
"To je chětro techniski zmylk, kiž rěka, zo je so zmylk stał při akceptowanju "
"syćoweho zwiska wot wonka."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:935
msgid "You may not have permissions to accept the connection."
msgstr "Snadź nimaće prawa zwisk akceptować."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:940
#, c-format
msgid "Could Not Login: %1"
msgstr "Njemóžach so přizjewić: %1"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:941
msgid "An attempt to login to perform the requested operation was unsuccessful."
msgstr "Pospyt přizjewjenja, zo by pominanu akciju wuwjedł, njeje so poradźił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:952
msgid "Could Not Determine Resource Status"
msgstr "Njemóžach staw resursy zwěsćić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:953
msgid "Could Not Stat Resource"
msgstr "Njemóžach staw resursy zwěsćić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:954
msgid ""
"An attempt to determine information about the status of the resource <strong>"
"%1</strong>, such as the resource name, type, size, etc., was unsuccessful."
msgstr ""
"Pospyt, informaciju wo resursy <strong>%1</strong> zwěsćić, na př. "
"mjeno, typ, wulkosć, njeje so poradźił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:957
msgid "The specified resource may not have existed or may not be accessible."
msgstr "Pominana resursa snadź njeeksistuje abo njesteji k dispoziciji."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:965
msgid "Could Not Cancel Listing"
msgstr "Njemóžach słuchanje přetorhnyć"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:966
msgid "FIXME: Document this"
msgstr "FIXME: Document this"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:970
msgid "Could Not Create Directory"
msgstr "Njemóžach zapisk stworić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:971
msgid "An attempt to create the requested directory failed."
msgstr "Pospyt, pominany zapisk stworić, so njeje poradźił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:972
msgid "The location where the directory was to be created may not exist."
msgstr "Městno, hdźež měješe so zapisk stworić, snadź njeeksistuje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:979
msgid "Could Not Remove Directory"
msgstr "Njemóžach zapisk zničić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:980
msgid "An attempt to remove the specified directory, <strong>%1</strong>, failed."
msgstr "Pospyt, zapisk <strong>%1</strong> zničić, njeje so poradźił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:982
msgid "The specified directory may not exist."
msgstr "Pominany zapisk snadź njeeksistuje."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:983
msgid "The specified directory may not be empty."
msgstr "Pominany zapisk snadź njebě prózdny."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:986
msgid "Ensure that the directory exists and is empty, and try again."
msgstr "Přepruwujće,hač zapisk eksistuje a hač je prózdny, a spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:991
msgid "Could Not Resume File Transfer"
msgstr "Njemóžach z transferom dataje pokročować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:992
msgid ""
"The specified request asked that the transfer of file <strong>%1</strong> be "
"resumed at a certain point of the transfer. This was not possible."
msgstr ""
"Bě so pominało, zo by so z transferom dataje <strong>%1</strong> wot "
"wěsteho městna sem pokročowało. To njebě móžno."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:995
msgid "The protocol, or the server, may not support file resuming."
msgstr "Protokol abo server snadź njepodpěruje přestawanje a pokročowanje transfera."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:997
msgid "Retry the request without attempting to resume transfer."
msgstr "Spytaj akciju hišće raz bjez pokročowanja stareho transfera."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1002
msgid "Could Not Rename Resource"
msgstr "Njemóžach resursu přemjenować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1003
msgid "An attempt to rename the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "Pospyt, resursu <strong>%1</strong> přemjenować, njeje so poradźił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1011
msgid "Could Not Alter Permissions of Resource"
msgstr "Njemóžach prawa resursy změnić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1012
msgid ""
"An attempt to alter the permissions on the specified resource <strong>%1</"
"strong> failed."
msgstr "Pospyt, přistupne prawa resursy <strong>%1</strong> změnić, njeje so poradźił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1019
msgid "Could Not Delete Resource"
msgstr "Njemóžach resursu zničić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1020
msgid "An attempt to delete the specified resource <strong>%1</strong> failed."
msgstr "Pospyt, resursu <strong>%1</strong> zničić, njeje so poradźił."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1027
msgid "Unexpected Program Termination"
msgstr "Njewočakowany kónc programa"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1028
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has unexpectedly terminated."
msgstr ""
"Program na tutym computeru, kiž so stara wo <strong>%1</strong-protokol, "
"je so njejapcy přetorhnył."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1036
msgid "Out Of Memory"
msgstr "Žadyn swobodny pomjatk"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1037
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol could not obtain the memory required to continue."
msgstr ""
"Program na tutym computeru, kiž so stara wo <strong>%1</strong>-protokol, "
"njemóžeše telko pomjatka dóstać, kaž bě trěbne."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1045
msgid "Unknown Proxy Host"
msgstr "Njeznaty proxy"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1046
msgid ""
"While retrieving information about the specified proxy host, <strong>%1</"
"strong>, an Unknown Host error was encountered. An unknown host error "
"indicates that the requested name could not be located on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Při wobstaranju informacije wo proxyjowym serveru je so <strong>%1</strong> "
"zmylk \"Njeznaty host\" stał. Tutón zmylk na to pokazuje, zo njebě móžno, "
"server z podatym mjenom w interneće namakać."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1050
msgid ""
"There may have been a problem with your network configuration, specifically "
"your proxy's hostname. If you have been accessing the Internet with no "
"problems recently, this is unlikely."
msgstr ""
"Snadź je to problem wašeje syćoweje konfiguracije. Njejsće-li pak w "
"poslednim času problemy měli ze zwiskom do interneta, njeje to prawdźepodobne. "

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1054
msgid "Double-check your proxy settings and try again."
msgstr "Přepruwuj podaća wo proxyju a spytaj hišće raz."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1059
msgid "Authentication Failed: Method %1 Not Supported"
msgstr "Awtentifikacija njeje so poradźiła: Metoda %1 njeje podpěrana."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1061
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Although you may have supplied the correct authentication details, the "
"authentication failed because the method that the server is using is not "
"supported by the KDE program implementing the protocol %1."
msgstr ""
"Hačrunjež sće najskerje korektnu informaciju wo awtentifikaciji zapodali, "
"njeje so přizjewjenje poradźiło, dokelž so wot servera wužiwane metody "
"wot KDE-programa, kiž implementuje protokol %1, njepodpěruja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1065
msgid ""
"Please file a bug at <a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</"
"a> to inform the KDE team of the unsupported authentication method."
msgstr ""
"Prošu ropraw pola a href=\"http://bugs.kde.org/\">http://bugs.kde.org/</"
"a> wo tutym zmylku."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1071
msgid "Request Aborted"
msgstr "Pominanje cofnjene"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1078
msgid "Internal Error in Server"
msgstr "Nutřkowny zmylk w serveru"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1079
msgid ""
"The program on the server which provides access to the <strong>%1</strong> "
"protocol has reported an internal error: %0."
msgstr ""
"Program na serveru, kiž zaruči přistup k protokolej <strong>%1</strong> "
"je zdźělił nutřkowny zmylk: %0."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1082
msgid ""
"This is most likely to be caused by a bug in the server program. Please "
"consider submitting a full bug report as detailed below."
msgstr ""
"Najskerje je to zmylk w programje servera. Prošu pósćelće informaciju "
"wo zmylku kaž deleka wuwjedźene."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1085
msgid "Contact the administrator of the server to advise them of the problem."
msgstr ""
"Stajće so z administratorom servera do zwiska, zo byće jemu wo problemje "
"rozprawili."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1087
msgid ""
"If you know who the authors of the server software are, submit the bug "
"report directly to them."
msgstr "Jeli wěš, štó je program napisał, wobroć so direktnje na njeho."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1092
msgid "Timeout Error"
msgstr "Zmylk: sym so načakał"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1093
msgid ""
"Although contact was made with the server, a response was not received "
"within the amount of time allocated for the request as follows:"
"<ul><li>Timeout for establishing a connection: %1 seconds</li><li>Timeout "
"for receiving a response: %2 seconds</li><li>Timeout for accessing proxy "
"servers: %3 seconds</li></ul>Please note that you can alter these timeout "
"settings in the KDE Control Center, by selecting Network -> Preferences."
msgstr ""
"Hačrunjež je so server kontaktował, njeje za postajeny čas žana wotmołwa "
"přišła: "
"<ul><li>timeout za nastajenje zwiska: %1 sek.</li> "
"<li>timeout za dóstawanje wotmołwy: %2 sek.</li> "
"<li>timeout za přistup na proxyjowy server: %3 sek.</li> "
"Tute nastajenja móžeće w KDE-konfiguraciji pod syć -> konfiguracija změnić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1104
msgid "The server was too busy responding to other requests to respond."
msgstr "Server bě přećeženy z druhimi nadawkami."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1110
msgid "Unknown Error"
msgstr "Njeznaty zmylk"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1111
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has reported an unknown error: %2."
msgstr ""
"Program na tutym computeru, kiž zaruča přistup na <strong>%1</strong> "
"-protokol je na njeznaty zmylk storčił: %2."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1119
msgid "Unknown Interruption"
msgstr "Njeznate přetorhnjenje"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1120
msgid ""
"The program on your computer which provides access to the <strong>%1</"
"strong> protocol has reported an interruption of an unknown type: %2."
msgstr ""
"Program na tutym computeru, kiž zaruča přistup na <strong>%1</strong> "
"-protokol je na njeznate přetorhnjenje storčił: %2."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1128
msgid "Could Not Delete Original File"
msgstr "Njemóžach originalnu dataju zničić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1129
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the deleting of the original file, most "
"likely at the end of a file move operation. The original file <strong>%1</"
"strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Pominana akcija sej zničenje originalneje dataje žadaše, najskerje "
"na kóncu přesunjenja dataje. Originalna dataja <strong>%1</strong> "
"so pak njehodźi zničić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1138
msgid "Could Not Delete Temporary File"
msgstr "Njemóžach temporarnu dataju zničić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1139
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file in which "
"to save the new file while being downloaded. This temporary file <strong>%1</"
"strong> could not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Pominana akcija sej stworjenje nachwilneje dataje žadaše (za zawěsćenje) "
"datow noweje dataje). Tuta nachwilna dataja <strong>%1</strong> "
"so pak njehodźeše zničić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1148
msgid "Could Not Rename Original File"
msgstr "Njemóžach originalnu dataju přemjenować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1149
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the renaming of the original file <strong>%"
"1</strong>, however it could not be renamed."
msgstr ""
"Pominana akcija sej žadaše přemjenowanje originalneje dataje <strong>%1</strong>, "
"kiž so pak njehodźeše přemjenować."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1157
msgid "Could Not Rename Temporary File"
msgstr "Njemóžach temporarnu dataju přemjenować"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1158
msgid ""
"The requested operation required the creation of a temporary file <strong>%"
"1</strong>, however it could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Pominana akcija sej žadaše stworjenje nachwilneje dataje <strong>%1</strong>, "
"kiž so pak njehodźeše stworić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1166
msgid "Could Not Create Link"
msgstr "Njemóžach link stworić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1167
msgid "Could Not Create Symbolic Link"
msgstr "Njemóžach wotkaz stworić"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1168
msgid "The requested symbolic link %1 could not be created."
msgstr "Žadany wotkaz %1 njehodźeše so stworić."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1175
msgid "No Content"
msgstr "Žadyn wobsah"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1180
msgid "Disk Full"
msgstr "Disk połny"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1181
msgid ""
"The requested file <strong>%1</strong> could not be written to as there is "
"inadequate disk space."
msgstr ""
"Njebě móžno, dataju <strong>%1</strong> pisać, dokelž njebě dosć "
"ruma na disku."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1183
msgid ""
"Free up enough disk space by 1) deleting unwanted and temporary files; 2) "
"archiving files to removable media storage such as CD-Recordable discs; or "
"3) obtain more storage capacity."
msgstr ""
"Wuswobodźće dosć městna na disku přez to, zo 1) njetrěbne a nachwilne "
"dataje zničiš, 2) daty na mobilne nošaki kaž CDki pisaće 3) sej wjetši "
"disk kupiće :-)"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1190
msgid "Source and Destination Files Identical"
msgstr "Žórłowa a cilowa dataja stej samsna dataja"

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1191
msgid ""
"The operation could not be completed because the source and destination "
"files are the same file."
msgstr "Akcija so njehodźeše přewjesć, dokelž sej žórło a cil samsna dataja."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1193
msgid "Choose a different filename for the destination file."
msgstr "Wubjerće hinaše datajowe mjeno za cilowu dataju."

#: kio/kio/global.cpp:1198
msgid "Undocumented Error"
msgstr "Njedokumentowany zmylk"

