#: kdeprint/management/kminstancepage.cpp:63
msgid ""
"Define/Edit here instances for the current selected printer. An instance is "
"a combination of a real (physical) printer and a set of predefined options. "
"For a single InkJet printer, you could define different print formats like "
"<i>DraftQuality</i>, <i>PhotoQuality</i> or <i>TwoSided</i>. Those instances "
"appear as normal printers in the print dialog and allow you to quickly "
"select the print format you want."
msgstr ""
"Tu definujeće abo editujeće instancy za aktualnje wubrany ćišćak. "
"Instanca je kombinacija realneho (fyzikalisce) ćišćaka a mnóstwo "
"predefinowanych opcijow. Za samsny InkJet móhł na př. wšelake "
"wašnja ćišćenja definować kaž <i>Naćisk</i>, <i>Foto</i> abo "
"<i>Dwustronsce</i>. Tute instancy so jewja w ćišćenskim dialogu "
"kaž separatne ćišćaki a wam dowola, spěšnje ćišćenske opcije wubrać. "

